flowchart TB
  subgraph Untrusted[不可信来源]
    Git[Git README / Code]
    Web[URL / Documents]
  end
  subgraph Authorized[授权的执行边界]
    Inspect[Inspector: read-only]
    Model[Model + Schema Check]
    Build[Compiler: sandbox]
    QA[QA + License Gate]
  end
  Git --> Inspect
  Web --> Inspect
  Inspect -->|data only| Model
  Model --> Build --> QA
  QA -->|passed| Artifacts[授权输出目录]
  Secret[(凭据/敏感目录)] -.拒绝读取.-> Inspect
